BT /F2 20.00 Tf 54.00 738.00 Td (CONVERA UI Manual) Tj ET
BT /F2 15.00 Tf 54.00 695.20 Td (Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 662.40 Td (The CONVERA UI is a local FastAPI dashboard for running prompts and viewing high-level runtime) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 648.40 Td (metrics. It is designed for local testing, demos, and repeated-prompt validation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 624.60 Td (The UI files are:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 54.00 591.00 Td (ui/app.py) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 54.00 578.50 Td (ui/static/index.html) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 54.00 566.00 Td (ui/dashboard.py) Tj ET
BT /F2 15.00 Tf 54.00 528.90 Td (Start The UI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 496.10 Td (From the project root:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 54.00 462.50 Td (uvicorn ui.app:app --reload) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 430.40 Td (Open the dashboard:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 54.00 396.80 Td (http://127.0.0.1:8000/static/index.html) Tj ET
BT /F2 15.00 Tf 54.00 359.70 Td (Before You Use The UI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 326.90 Td (Make sure a model exists at:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 54.00 293.30 Td (models/llama3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 261.20 Td (If not, download one:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 54.00 227.60 Td (python scripts/download_llama.py) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 195.50 Td (Some Hugging Face models require authentication and license acceptance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15.00 Tf 54.00 166.70 Td (UI Layout) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 133.90 Td (The page has two main areas:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 110.10 Td (1. Prompt panel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 96.10 Td (2. Metrics panel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 72.30 Td (It also includes a benchmark graph panel below the main grid when a graph has) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 58.30 Td (been generated by python -m metrics.benchmark_runner.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
